              "Recognize vowels and consonants",
              "Put letters in alphabetical order"
            ]
          ],
          [
            "Explanation",
            "<h3>What is the Alphabet?</h3><p>The <b>English alphabet</b> is a set of letters used to write every word in the language.<br>Each letter has a name and one or more sounds.</p>"
          ],
          [
            "Multiple Choice",
            "How many letters does the English alphabet have?",
            [
              "24",
              "26",
              "28",
              "30"
            ],
            1
          ],
          [
            "Explanation",
            "<h3>Uppercase and lowercase</h3><p>Every letter has two forms:<br>An <b>UPPERCASE form</b> (A, B, C) used at the start of sentences and names, and a <b>lowercase form</b> (a, b, c) used in the rest of the word.</p>"
          ],
          [
            "Multiple Choice",
